        "metadata": {
          "author": "Momma Bear Audio",
          "description": "Are you gifting lots of Yoto cards? I made a fun playlist that allows kids to hunt through the house for new Yoto cards!\n\nTo play this game, kids will have 1 MYO Yoto card that they get on Christmas with this playlist on it. This will play the “intro” with directions and then all the riddles with different locations to find cards. I recommend reviewing the transcript so you can see all the locations and riddles if you have any specific questions on those!This is a build your own playlist. You download the audio and then make the playlist with the locations you want to include and the amount of locations you want to include.So if you have 6 Yoto cards to gift, your upload will look like this:IntroLocation 1Location 2Location 3Location 4Location 5Location 6OutroYou can choose any locations that you want. There is no specific order for the locations! Use what works for your family and makes sense for your family!Important note!!When making your playlist in Yoto, be sure to click the 3 buttons on the right side of each track and select “Pause. wait for button press” so the audio doesn’t continue on and they can search for the Yoto card after listening!!There is no Yoto Link for this playlist as it’s a build-your-own. You can choose the locations of the hiding places and how many hiding places.\n\nLooking for other free audio sources, ideas and inspo? Maybe you want to submit a request for some sort of specific audio for your kids? Join my FB Group! I am always taking suggestions and working to get the audio your kids want.\nToyo Momma Bear source: 1a5a195b1facddfda9099db0bc34701529e64b97e155755c9cf20639d51fe257",
